# Next.js

- App Router. Server Components by default; `"use client"` only where needed.
- Shared components in `src/components`, utilities in `src/lib`, domains in `src/features/<domain>`.
- Lowercase, hyphenated directories; components in `PascalCase.tsx`.
- Validation with zod on the server, always.
- User-facing UI in Spanish from Argentina with voseo; numbers with `Intl.NumberFormat("es-AR")`.
- No valuation logic in components: it goes in `@plant/core`.
- Prefer server state; minimize `useEffect` and `useState`.
